Facts from other projects
-------------------------

The vendor does not publish the local API. The method names, parameter
names, value ranges, ports, module-name classes and scene numbers this
module uses are facts read from these public sources. No code or prose
was taken from any of them; see PROVENANCE.md for which fact came from
where and the commits read.

- pywizlight (github.com/sbidy/pywizlight; MIT, Copyright (c) 2020
  Stephan Traub).
- wiz-local-control, the vendor's own library
  (gitlab.com/wizlighting/wiz-local-control; MIT, Copyright (c) 2018
  WiZLighting).
- Home Assistant's WiZ integration (github.com/home-assistant/core;
  Apache-2.0).
- openHAB's WiZ binding (github.com/openhab/openhab-addons; EPL-2.0).

